{
  "name": "Echo",
  "type": "dark",
  "semanticHighlighting": true,
  "_designSystem": [
    "Echo IDE theme.",
    "",
    "Workbench chrome is strictly monochrome, drawn only from the design token table:",
    "  bg/base #000000  bg/inset #050505  bg/raised #0a0a0a",
    "  border/hair #1f1f1f  border/mid #2a2a2a  border/strong #5a5a5a  border/full #ffffff",
    "  text/primary #ffffff  text/secondary #8a8a8a  text/muted #5a5a5a",
    "",
    "The editor viewport is the documented exception: syntax tokens, diagnostics,",
    "diff gutters, bracket pairs and minimap marks use conventional code colors so",
    "reading and reviewing code works the way developers expect. The design document",
    "asked for monochrome code; that was overridden deliberately."
  ],
